OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sat 29 Aug to Mon 7 SepFAn
OL,6,Funsettled start to this period, as
OL,7,Fshowers or longer spells of rain are
OL,8,Fpossible across many parts of the UK.
OL,9,FSome heavy rain is likely, perhaps
OL,10,Fwith some thunderstorms too. It will
OL,11,Flikely remain changeable into early
OL,12,FSeptember, with rainfall amounts
OL,13,Fprobably above average for the time
OL,14,Fyear and the potential for some strong
OL,15,Fwinds at times. However, some drier,
OL,16,Fmore settled interludes could develop
OL,17,Fat times. Temperatures are likely to
OL,18,Fbe near average, although some short-
OL,19,Flived warm or hot spells are possible,
OL,20,Fespecially in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
