OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1787618858
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tue 8 Sep to Tue 22 Sep
OL,6,FMost likely a continuation of the
OL,7,Fgenerally unsettled conditions at
OL,8,Ffirst with showers or longer spells of
OL,9,Frain across many areas, perhaps heavy
OL,10,Fand thundery in places. However, there
OL,11,Fmay still be some drier interludes at
OL,12,Ftimes. Further into September, drier
OL,13,Fweather may become more prevalent,
OL,14,Fespecially in the south and southeast,
OL,15,Fwith any more unsettled conditions
OL,16,Ftending to become more likely further
OL,17,Fnorth and northwest. Temperatures will
OL,18,Fprobably be near normal at first but
OL,19,Fmay become warmer later, with the
OL,20,Fpossibility of some hot spells in the
OL,21,Fsouth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
